1
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:12,360
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,810
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,620
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:21,960
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,480
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:32,220
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:36,090
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:39,560
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:42,810
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:45,560
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:49,100
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,980
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:00,360
=Episode 15=

15
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:02,679
Greetings, Honglian Sword Immortal.

16
00:01:07,519 --> 00:01:09,400
You were pretty defiant before.

17
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:10,920
Now you know how to bow?

18
00:01:11,879 --> 00:01:13,079
Well, I need a favor from you.

19
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:14,359
How could I not bow my head?

20
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:16,840
Good.

21
00:01:17,319 --> 00:01:19,200
You certainly know
what you like and dislike.

22
00:01:19,799 --> 00:01:20,920
I like it.

23
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:25,120
Where are the other two Sword Immortals?

24
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:35,799
What?

25
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,680
Am I

26
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:39,719
not enough for you?

27
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:41,480
No, no!

28
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:42,599
I was just asking after them.

29
00:01:46,879 --> 00:01:48,319
Your cultivation is too weak.

30
00:01:48,879 --> 00:01:51,079
If all three of us taught you together,

31
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:53,519
you might never master any of it
in your lifetime.

32
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:56,920
So we'll take turns.

33
00:01:58,319 --> 00:02:02,239
If you can't even grasp my teaching,

34
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:04,719
then forget about meeting the other two.

35
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:10,919
Of course,

36
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,919
I quite like you.

37
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:15,159
But I can't keep teaching you forever.

38
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:16,199
So,

39
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:18,599
you've got three days.

40
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,520
If I'm satisfied with your progress,

41
00:02:20,879 --> 00:02:21,800
you can stay.

42
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,319
If you can't,

43
00:02:23,599 --> 00:02:24,479
then leave.

44
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,360
I'll do my best.

45
00:02:27,759 --> 00:02:28,840
What level is your cultivation now?

46
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:29,719
Sword Immortal,

47
00:02:30,199 --> 00:02:31,159
Spirit Burst Realm, Stage 9.

48
00:02:32,319 --> 00:02:33,639
In just over half a year,

49
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,479
you've already reached Stage 9?

50
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:38,840
Even if you were gifted,

51
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:40,400
given that you started over,

52
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,719
how could you advance so fast?

53
00:02:47,704 --> 00:02:48,597
(Spirit Burst Realm, Stage 9)

54
00:02:50,577 --> 00:02:51,497
(Spirit Burst Realm, Stage 9)

55
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,080
Not bad.

56
00:02:57,879 --> 00:02:59,439
So you absorbed all the energy

57
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,680
from that old man's spirit vein.

58
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:03,360
Your Dao Bone is quite interesting.

59
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:04,960
But let me warn you.

60
00:03:05,719 --> 00:03:07,599
That old man from Sword Immortal Inn

61
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,319
holds a grudge.

62
00:03:09,639 --> 00:03:10,680
If you ever run into him,

63
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,560
just escape.

64
00:03:12,719 --> 00:03:13,520
Yeah, I'd better.

65
00:03:14,919 --> 00:03:15,479
Come with me.

66
00:03:21,159 --> 00:03:22,159
These are the swords

67
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:24,479
we three have collected
over the centuries.

68
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:27,240
You can't practice swordsmanship
without a sword.

69
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,159
Even the lowest-grade ones here

70
00:03:29,319 --> 00:03:30,319
are mid-grade spirit weapons.

71
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:32,319
Pick any one you like.

72
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:43,639
Want some recommendations?

73
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:51,199
This one is Mystique.

74
00:03:51,719 --> 00:03:52,560
It's light and nimble.

75
00:03:52,919 --> 00:03:54,479
It cuts through the air silently
and kills without a trace.

76
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:56,000
Perfect for surprise attacks.

77
00:04:06,039 --> 00:04:06,919
This one is Fine Snow.

78
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,319
Forged from Tianshan cold iron.

79
00:04:08,599 --> 00:04:09,639
It carries the power of ice.

80
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,360
It can slow down an enemy's weapon,

81
00:04:11,719 --> 00:04:13,599
giving you an edge in battle.

82
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,800
This is the Mystic Iron Greatsword.

83
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:32,519
It's incredibly powerful

84
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:33,879
and nearly indestructible.

85
00:04:34,399 --> 00:04:36,160
It's just a little on the heavy side.

86
00:04:36,439 --> 00:04:37,319
But you're a man.

87
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:38,399
A little extra weight won't hurt.

88
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:40,160
It suits your style, too.

89
00:04:45,759 --> 00:04:47,079
Nothing works for you?

90
00:04:47,639 --> 00:04:49,000
Aren't you usually decisive?

91
00:04:49,279 --> 00:04:50,639
Why are you suddenly so indecisive?

92
00:04:50,879 --> 00:04:51,519
Immortal Venerable,

93
00:04:52,079 --> 00:04:52,720
I...

94
00:04:53,839 --> 00:04:54,639
I like that one!

95
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,000
That one won't do.

96
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:04,040
You said I could pick any one.

97
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,000
Why can't I have that one?

98
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:05,920
Any but that one.

99
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,319
The rest are yours to choose from.

100
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:09,480
Forget it, then.

101
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,959
I'll just find a branch out there.

102
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:12,839
It'll do.

103
00:05:13,959 --> 00:05:14,759
(My storage ring)

104
00:05:15,079 --> 00:05:16,439
(is full of ordinary spirit weapons.)

105
00:05:16,839 --> 00:05:17,639
(But this sword)

106
00:05:18,079 --> 00:05:19,920
(makes me want it so badly.)

107
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,800
Why are you so stubborn?

108
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,160
You just won't listen.

109
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,720
You said I could pick.

110
00:05:25,879 --> 00:05:27,000
I don't like any of the others.

111
00:05:27,199 --> 00:05:27,839
What now?

112
00:05:30,079 --> 00:05:31,800
This sword is called Solitude.

113
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:34,759
It's a relic left by our master,

114
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:36,600
an ancient demonic sword.

115
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,199
It can consume the wielder's mind.

116
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:41,639
Even my master, a mighty cultivator,
was not immune.

117
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,399
For a thousand years
after my master's death,

118
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:48,120
no one has been able to wield it.

119
00:05:50,879 --> 00:05:51,560
I want to try.

120
00:05:53,639 --> 00:05:54,439
But I'm warning you.

121
00:05:55,199 --> 00:05:56,879
This sword seems to be cursed.

122
00:05:57,519 --> 00:05:59,480
Not only can it consume
its wielder's mind,

123
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:02,000
it can also bring misfortune upon them,

124
00:06:02,439 --> 00:06:03,720
and even hurt those around them.

125
00:06:04,519 --> 00:06:06,959
That's why it's called Solitude.

126
00:06:07,319 --> 00:06:07,839
Misfortune?

127
00:06:09,839 --> 00:06:11,199
I've got a blood feud to settle.

128
00:06:11,519 --> 00:06:13,040
My entire family was slaughtered.

129
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:16,399
How could I possibly care
about misfortune?

130
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:18,959
Fine.

131
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,879
Since you refuse to give up,

132
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:23,920
give it a try.

133
00:06:29,279 --> 00:06:29,959
But I must warn you.

134
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,680
Solitude is sentient.

135
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,399
It can choose its own master.

136
00:06:34,319 --> 00:06:36,920
For a thousand years, great cultivators
have come to the island for it.

137
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:37,879
Not one has succeeded.

138
00:06:39,199 --> 00:06:39,759
So,

139
00:06:40,279 --> 00:06:41,519
don't get your hopes up.

140
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:55,720
Something's wrong.

141
00:06:55,959 --> 00:06:56,600
Stop!

142
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:57,279
Stay back!

143
00:06:58,879 --> 00:06:59,920
It's reading my memories.

144
00:07:02,639 --> 00:07:03,199
It's fine.

145
00:07:03,959 --> 00:07:04,800
I can take it.

146
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,560
I told you it wouldn't work.

147
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,279
Why ask for trouble...?

148
00:07:15,524 --> 00:07:18,530
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

149
00:07:18,957 --> 00:07:22,070
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

150
00:07:22,351 --> 00:07:24,791
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

151
00:07:24,850 --> 00:07:28,561
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

152
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:32,639
Solitude.

153
00:07:33,399 --> 00:07:34,519
It really is a fine sword.

154
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:36,040
How is this possible?

155
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:37,040
Immortal Venerable,

156
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:38,759
this sword

157
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,600
is mine now.

158
00:07:41,079 --> 00:07:41,839
(In theory,)

159
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,839
(he shouldn't even qualify
to come to Sword Immortal Island.)

160
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:45,639
(He started over)

161
00:07:46,199 --> 00:07:47,759
(and received Bai Xi's help.)

162
00:07:48,199 --> 00:07:49,040
(Now he has made it here)

163
00:07:49,399 --> 00:07:50,639
(and Solitude has chosen him.)

164
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,319
(Everything seems like a coincidence,)

165
00:07:52,959 --> 00:07:55,079
(yet somehow, it feels like fate.)

166
00:07:56,399 --> 00:07:58,600
Looks like congratulations are in order.

167
00:07:59,399 --> 00:07:59,839
Let's go.

168
00:08:00,399 --> 00:08:01,399
We agreed on three days.

169
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:02,519
Two days remain.

170
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:05,720
How much you learn is up to you.

171
00:08:10,193 --> 00:08:11,873
(Three Days Later)

172
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,360
Heavenburn Sword Shadow!

173
00:08:19,959 --> 00:08:21,120
Crimson Flash of the Swan!

174
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:25,160
Heaven-Splitting Strike!

175
00:08:27,199 --> 00:08:27,839
(Good heavens!)

176
00:08:28,519 --> 00:08:29,759
(For an ordinary cultivator,)

177
00:08:30,279 --> 00:08:31,920
(even thirty years might not
be enough to master half a move.)

178
00:08:32,519 --> 00:08:33,919
(Yet he mastered all three sword arts)

179
00:08:34,399 --> 00:08:35,960
(to minor mastery in just three days.)

180
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,840
(What a monster!)

181
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,279
Are you satisfied

182
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:42,440
with my swordsmanship,
Immortal Venerable?

183
00:08:45,399 --> 00:08:45,960
Catch this wine!

184
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,399
It's brewed from Cold Spring water.

185
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:50,840
It's incredibly potent.

186
00:08:51,399 --> 00:08:51,879
Drink it.

187
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,919
Then train while the wine takes effect.

188
00:08:54,159 --> 00:08:54,919
Immortal Venerable,

189
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,080
I can't hold my liquor.

190
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:57,080
If I get drunk,

191
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:57,879
how can I train?

192
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:58,879
Once you drink it,

193
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:01,000
if you can burn off the alcohol
through swordplay,

194
00:09:01,559 --> 00:09:02,639
it'll temper your body,

195
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,519
and toughen your physique

196
00:09:04,879 --> 00:09:05,799
even more.

197
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:08,519
As you command.

198
00:09:10,302 --> 00:09:12,255
♪How many rains must pass♪

199
00:09:12,482 --> 00:09:15,108
♪Before someone comes to me?♪

200
00:09:15,162 --> 00:09:18,017
♪To spend this life with you♪

201
00:09:18,457 --> 00:09:20,723
♪A faint new moon, a touch of iris blue♪

202
00:09:20,743 --> 00:09:22,930
♪How deep the dreams♪

203
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:23,879
Train!

204
00:09:24,458 --> 00:09:28,560
♪Can three more lives see us through?♪

205
00:09:28,618 --> 00:09:31,232
♪East winds shift, snows remain♪

206
00:09:31,279 --> 00:09:34,082
♪Joy and pain, what fate ordains?♪

207
00:09:34,148 --> 00:09:35,955
♪Brush in hand, my joy, my pain♪

208
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,600
Letting go of your sword

209
00:09:39,320 --> 00:09:40,480
is a swordsman's greatest taboo.

210
00:09:40,879 --> 00:09:42,039
But, Immortal Venerable,

211
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:43,320
this wine...

212
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,039
It's too strong.

213
00:09:46,559 --> 00:09:47,320
Clear your mind.

214
00:09:47,799 --> 00:09:49,000
The Sword intent is you.

215
00:09:49,279 --> 00:09:50,399
You're the sword intent.

216
00:09:51,279 --> 00:09:52,200
Even drunk,

217
00:09:52,559 --> 00:09:53,399
even wounded,

218
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:54,720
even dying,

219
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,000
the sword must not stop!

220
00:09:56,016 --> 00:09:59,523
♪Can three more lives see us through?♪

221
00:09:59,617 --> 00:10:02,023
♪East winds shift, snows remain♪

222
00:10:02,287 --> 00:10:05,187
♪Joy and pain, what fate ordains?♪

223
00:10:05,260 --> 00:10:07,067
♪Brush in hand, my joy, my pain♪

224
00:10:07,101 --> 00:10:09,960
♪With moonlight in my cup,
I drink my longing♪

225
00:10:10,180 --> 00:10:12,853
♪For the rest of my life,
whose face will I seek?♪

226
00:10:12,906 --> 00:10:15,672
♪Rouge-stained tears deepen
the wounds I bear.♪

227
00:10:15,726 --> 00:10:21,094
♪In less than an instant,
how could love fall apart?♪

228
00:10:21,234 --> 00:10:23,520
♪I ask the world,
as blood blooms into flowers♪

229
00:10:23,562 --> 00:10:26,208
♪When petals fall,
whose obsession can't be severed?♪

230
00:10:26,288 --> 00:10:28,915
♪Falling from the cliff♪

231
00:10:29,399 --> 00:10:31,399
Though one sword can split the sky,

232
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:34,919
life is still but emptiness.

233
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:39,120
I roam the heavens, draining
a hundred cups to drown worldly dreams.

234
00:10:40,879 --> 00:10:42,639
I laugh at life's fleeting beauty.

235
00:10:42,688 --> 00:10:44,974
♪I ask the world,
as blood blooms into flowers♪

236
00:10:47,039 --> 00:10:48,120
(In just an instant,)

237
00:10:48,559 --> 00:10:49,720
(he entered a state of selflessness.)

238
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:52,399
(He's really a monster.)

239
00:10:52,404 --> 00:10:55,484
♪To tie our hair as one♪

240
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:56,919
How do you feel?

241
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:57,919
Still drunk?

242
00:10:58,399 --> 00:11:00,440
I've never felt this peaceful before.

243
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:03,840
What cultivation art do you practice?

244
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:04,759
Immortal Venerable,

245
00:11:05,679 --> 00:11:07,679
I practice my family's
Primordial Dao Art.

246
00:11:08,159 --> 00:11:08,759
Nonsense!

247
00:11:09,639 --> 00:11:12,279
That's only a human-tier
cultivation art of the lowest grade.

248
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:13,919
How could you be so talented

249
00:11:14,919 --> 00:11:16,320
while practicing an art like that?

250
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,360
I don't know.

251
00:11:19,159 --> 00:11:20,559
My father always told me

252
00:11:20,879 --> 00:11:22,840
it has been passed down in our family.

253
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:34,360
(It really is the Primordial Dao Art.)

254
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:35,440
(No.)

255
00:11:35,919 --> 00:11:37,960
(Its source seems
to be the Primordial Dao Art.)

256
00:11:38,559 --> 00:11:40,519
(But the details are different.)

257
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:41,919
(It's almost like...)

258
00:11:43,879 --> 00:11:44,759
(It's almost like...)

259
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:48,960
What is it, Immortal Venerable?

260
00:11:50,919 --> 00:11:51,440
Nothing.

261
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:52,960
You've trained well.

262
00:11:53,519 --> 00:11:54,399
As for swordsmanship,

263
00:11:55,039 --> 00:11:56,600
I have nothing left to teach you.

264
00:11:59,159 --> 00:12:01,120
Thanks for your guidance
these three days.

265
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:02,960
However,

266
00:12:03,799 --> 00:12:04,960
I may have another way

267
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:07,000
to raise your cultivation.

268
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:09,320
What way?

269
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:12,240
I obtained a secret manual

270
00:12:12,639 --> 00:12:14,200
about dual cultivation.

271
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:20,480
It lets both partners serve
as cultivation vessels.

272
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:23,039
Dual...

273
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:23,879
Dual cultivation?

274
00:12:27,617 --> 00:12:31,247
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

275
00:12:31,404 --> 00:12:34,074
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

276
00:12:34,334 --> 00:12:37,884
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

277
00:12:38,064 --> 00:12:42,264
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

278
00:12:42,714 --> 00:12:45,964
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

279
00:12:46,334 --> 00:12:49,144
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

280
00:12:49,454 --> 00:12:52,834
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

281
00:12:52,964 --> 00:12:57,194
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

282
00:12:57,634 --> 00:13:00,764
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

283
00:13:01,054 --> 00:13:04,134
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

284
00:13:04,704 --> 00:13:07,544
♪With this flesh and soul♪

285
00:13:07,774 --> 00:13:10,794
♪I shall forge a new age♪

286
00:13:11,131 --> 00:13:14,201
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

287
00:13:14,451 --> 00:13:17,541
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

288
00:13:17,761 --> 00:13:19,991
♪At cultivation's peak♪

289
00:13:20,131 --> 00:13:23,971
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

290
00:13:24,381 --> 00:13:27,001
♪The sun and moon turn♪

291
00:13:27,021 --> 00:13:30,691
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

292
00:13:31,151 --> 00:13:37,931
♪I am the undying flame♪

293
00:13:38,611 --> 00:13:43,331
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

294
00:13:43,681 --> 00:13:46,861
♪At last I see, immortality♪

295
00:13:47,021 --> 00:13:51,661
♪Lives in your smiles♪
